  "limitations": [
    "These are observed warm worker generation times through output saving, excluding startup, downloads, compilation, queueing and transfer to the client.",
    "Each mean uses two timed inputs after a warmup. Two samples are not a confidence interval.",
    "The sixteen public clips are the original Turbo outputs. Regular generation was also timed; its videos are not included in this selection.",
    "Submitted scene descriptions and seeds match. Cozy appends a blank line and non_diegetic_music: N/A; Comfy encodes the submitted text directly.",
    "Cozy uses FP8-rowwise text-encoder weights; Comfy stores BF16 text weights and its loader reports FP16. Identical conditioning and pixels are not claimed.",
    "Cozy encodes x264 CRF17/veryfast; Comfy uses CRF18 without a preset override. Whole-run times include these policies.",
    "Native one-GPU Runtime is 0.23.1; four/eight-GPU Runtime is 0.22.0. Relevant inference source and compiled kernel extension match, but the TensorD worker executable changed.",
    "The 5090s share a 420 W cap and use automatic boost. Cozy/Comfy denoising averaged 2170/1812 MHz for Turbo and 2012/1770 MHz for regular, around 66-67 C. GPU throttle-reason flags were not sampled.",
    "Single-GPU Cozy uses a shared-QKV producer; multi-GPU uses head-local materialized attention. This is application scaling with disclosed implementation differences.",
    "Native runs Turbo then regular with idle Turbo contexts retained. Comfy starts a fresh server for each GPU count and mode.",
    "The RTX 5090 host has no usable direct peer access. Four cards share a NUMA node; eight cross two nodes. The H100s have NVLink.",
    "All accepted clips passed full audio/video decoding, geometry, GPU-count, step-count and hash checks. These checks do not establish perceptual equivalence; judge quality from the originals.",
    "Worker-update-overlap samples were excluded and replaced. The replacement single-5090 Comfy regular sample recomputed conditioning and all 30 steps through a stock PrimitiveString cache invalidation."
  ],
